msgid "Support for the ``string`` keyword argument name is now deprecated and slated for removal in Python 3.19."
msgstr ""

msgid "Before Python 3.13, the ``string`` keyword parameter was not correctly supported depending on the backend implementation of hash functions. Prefer passing the initial data as a positional argument for maximum backwards compatibility."
msgstr ""

